# 13_astral_deep_RGB.ledc — Astral Deep / Vibrational (Focus 12), RGB inner/outer build
# RGB variant of 13_astral_deep. Audio + speech IDENTICAL (deep binaural OBE arc, ~50 min).
# Near-darkness, NO flicker (freq 0 = steady), very dim warm amber: inner amber ember
# (mask 9, 255,160,32) + outer deep-red ember (mask 6, 255,24,16), steady, breathing LFO
# in the early phases; the long deep hold sits at a near-dark ~3% ember. Brightness <=12%.
# See base header for safety.
#
# LED: time freq duty bright R G B mask   (freq 0 = STEADY)

# --- Induction: alpha 10 Hz; vol + light fade in ---
0 0 50 >0 255 160 32 9      # inner amber ember: steady, bright fade-in
0 0 50 >0 255 24  16 6      # outer deep-red ember: steady
A 0 210 0 >0 0 1 220 0       # ch1 binaural: carrier 210 / R220 => 10 Hz beat; vol fade-in
S 3000 default 65 "Relax completely. Let every muscle soften, and let the body grow still."
15000 0 50 12 255 160 32 9  # inner: 12% reached
15000 0 50 12 255 24  16 6  # outer
30000 0 50 ~4:10:12000 255 160 32 9   # inner: breathing 4<->10%
30000 0 50 ~4:10:12000 255 24  16 6   # outer
A 60000 210 0 80 0 1 220 0   # vol 40; carrier held 210 => alpha 10 Hz

# --- Staged descent (beat 10->7->3.5) ---
A 360000 >210 0 80 0 1 220 0  # carrier 210->213 => beat 10->7
360000 0 50 ~3:8:12000 255 160 32 9   # inner: dimmer breathing 3<->8%
360000 0 50 ~3:8:12000 255 24  16 6   # outer
S 360000 default 65 "Let go now, drifting downward, sinking deeper with every slow breath."
A 660000 >213 0 80 0 1 220 0  # carrier 213->216.5 => beat 7->3.5

# --- Vibrational plateau: long flat hold (beat ~3.5 Hz) ---
A 960000 216.5 0 80 0 1 220 0 # carrier 216.5 => beat 3.5 Hz held flat (the "vibrational" threshold)
960000 0 50 3 255 160 32 9    # inner: near-dark ember ~3%
960000 0 50 3 255 24  16 6    # outer
S 960000 default 65 "Mind awake, body asleep. Rest at the threshold, still and aware."
S 1600000 default 65 "Feel the vibrations rise. Let them move through you, and simply allow it."

# --- Gentle return to alpha (beat 3.5->10) ---
A 2520000 >216.5 0 80 0 1 220 0  # carrier 216.5->210 => beat 3.5->10; resurface
2520000 0 50 >3 255 160 32 9  # inner: bright 3->12
2520000 0 50 >3 255 24  16 6  # outer
S 2520000 default 65 "Gently now. Beginning the slow return, rising back toward the body."

# --- Soft close: vol + brightness fade out ---
A 2880000 210 0 >80 0 1 220 0 # beat alpha 10; vol 40->0 over final 120 s
2880000 0 50 >12 255 160 32 9 # inner: bright 12->0
2880000 0 50 >12 255 24  16 6 # outer
S 2880000 default 65 "Coming back to the room now, calm, clear, and whole."
A 3000000 210 0 0 0 1 220 0   # volume 0
3000000 0 50 0 255 160 32 9   # inner off
3000000 0 50 0 255 24  16 6   # outer off
